WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.291
Today, we're going to learn
how to make the most basic vitality pills.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.333
The procedures are simple,

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:10.541
so I'm going to make it quick.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:12.500
I hope you can keep up with me.

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:14.333
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:17.875
STEPS TO MAKE VITALITY PILLS
INSTRUCTOR: PAN SHENGCONG

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.375
Steps to make vitality pills.

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:24.000
First, get a Yangcheng pot ready.

00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:24.875
Next,

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:28.416
take gold sand,
tortoiseshell, and dragon bone.

00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:30.416
Cut up, grind, and put it in.

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:32.041
Cut up some Acorus tatarinowii.

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.791
Cut up some Radix polygalae.
Scatter it in.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:35.916
Add Powder Number 15
and 7 drops of lapis lazuli oil.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.625
Flatten it, put it in the furnace,
and close it.

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:39.500
Tape it, seal up the furnace,
and start the fire.

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.666
Set the alarm to 5 p.m.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.208
Are you all clear about the process?

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.250
Now let's see what you can do.

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:52.916
It's time for me to show them
what I've got.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:56.833
First, refining pills is an art of fire.

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.541
The big cauldron of the Chen family

00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:02.625
was designed for refining
large quantities of pills.

00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:06.708
For a small quantity like this,
it's hard to control the time for heating.

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.166
Sun Rong behaves like she knows something.

00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:17.416
She even brought the refining machine
from her family's factory?

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.000
Does that even count as her own effort?

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.291
What?

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:26.458
Someone is using a microwave oven
to do the refining.

